{
 "encounter_id": "00981",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Dr Banerjee, Mr Chatterjee is here, he's got a swollen finger. I've done his obs: blood pressure 136 over 84, pulse 78, temperature 36.8, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16, weight 80 kilos."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, nurse. Please come in, Mr Chatterjee. Which finger? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "This one. The ring finger, the left one. It's swollen like a sausage, doctor. I... it's been, how do I say, quite a few weeks now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A sausage-like swelling of the whole finger. How many weeks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks, I think. Maybe five."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it painful?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a throbbing pain, worse in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any stiffness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Stiff, yes. I cannot make a fist with that hand until about ten o'clock."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any change in the nails?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few little pits, tiny dents in the nails. I noticed last month."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any redness or fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No redness, no fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any injury to the finger?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no injury."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any eye problems, redness or pain in the eyes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my eyes are fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. And omeprazole, 20 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sulfa. A rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Psoriasis, since my thirties. High blood pressure. And acid reflux."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix, in 1998. And a hernia, in 2012."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any arthritis or skin trouble in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My brother has psoriasis, and his joints are bad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Retired bank manager."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smoking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I stopped smoking in 2010."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A glass of wine with dinner."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at the finger.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Please be gentle. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The whole left ring finger is swollen evenly, from the knuckle to the tip, and it's tender."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's also scaling on the elbows, consistent with psoriasis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, always. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your back, stiffness in the lower back in the mornings?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. My back is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Chatterjee, a whole finger swollen like this, together with psoriasis and nail pitting, suggests psoriatic arthritis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Arthritis. Oh dear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd say it's likely, but I can't rule out a gout attack or an infection in the tendon sheath, though the lack of fever makes infection less likely."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gout? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can do the same thing to a finger. I'd like to arrange an X-ray of both hands, blood tests including uric acid and inflammation markers, and an ultrasound of the finger."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll book the X-ray for this morning. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to refer you to the rheumatology clinic."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it urgent? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll mark it as soon. Meanwhile, keep taking your tablets as usual, and use a warm compress in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
